proxmox-mcp-vr
==============

This product wraps and reuses code from:

  ProxmoxMCP-Plus
  https://github.com/RekklesNA/ProxmoxMCP-Plus
  Copyright (c) RekklesNA and contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The upstream project is installed as a runtime dependency. This package
introspects its FastMCP tool registry to filter out destructive tools and
adds in-guest QEMU agent control tools required for VR/RE/exploit-dev
workflows.

No upstream source files are copied into this repository.
